exit 0. stderr vacío. El stdout es JSON. Comprobado con el Python del venv limpio 3.12, fuera del proceso de la CLI:

- schema_version 0.1, verdict better, compare A y B
- cost_per_solved_task A 0.000498375, B 0.0104
- tasks A 8 (8 resueltas), B 8 (7 resueltas)
- pairing.mode paired, pairs 8, unmatched A 0 y B 0, warning null
- cost mean_difference -0.008601625
- cost interval low -0.008896, high -0.0083295375, includes_zero false
- relative_change_percent -94.523351648352, relative interval [-94.911764705882, -93.96694214876], relative_includes_zero false

